  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 302.36 Storage facility",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 302.36 “Storage facility” means a permanently affixed enclosed space used for the accumulation and subsequent distribution of motor fuel at the wholesale level. The term does not include any product contained in a facility that is attached to a pump used for retail sale to the public.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1 and #2 at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 300) #10032, eff 11-22-11; renumbered by #10753 (formerly Saf-C 302.28); ss by #13186, eff 4-7-21 (formerly Saf-C 302.33)",
